  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "52426aafea5b99b7",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 3.1 Flash-Lite：为规模化智能而打造",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d7ad96ea7cb14429",
      "translationZh": "为您业务量最大的工作负载提供同类最佳的智能能力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a21b58ba4c2f878a",
      "translationZh": "您的浏览器不支持音频元素。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9396d34c840bf012",
      "translationZh": "此内容由 Google AI 生成。生成式 AI 尚处于实验阶段",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "34417c1991b61c51",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 3.1 Flash-Lite 现已推出预览版，开发者可通过 Google AI Studio 中的 Gemini API 使用，企业可通过 Vertex AI 使用。其定价为每 1M 输入词元 0.25、每 1M 输出词元 1.50，成本效益高，速度也比 2.5 Flash 更快。可使用 3.1 Flash-Lite 执行翻译、内容审核、生成用户界面和创建模拟等任务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6b43a10482221e5d",
      "translationZh": "摘要由 Google AI 生成。生成式 AI 尚处于实验阶段。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c26b0133446b7d43",
      "translationZh": "Google 推出了一款名为 Gemini 3.1 Flash-Lite 的新 AI 模型。它速度超快，使用成本低，因此更多人可以使用它。这款 AI 擅长语言翻译和内容检查等任务。一些公司已经在使用它解决棘手的问题，因为它既智能又高效。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f344ef9188695765",
      "translationZh": "探索其他风格：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "68a1d129c48edbfb",
      "translationZh": "今天，我们推出 Gemini 3.1 Flash-Lite，这是 Gemini 3 系列中速度最快、成本效益最高的模型。3.1 Flash-Lite 专为大规模、高吞吐量的开发者工作负载打造，在其价格和模型档位下提供高质量表现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0c7f22be2e7295ae",
      "translationZh": "从今天起，3.1 Flash-Lite 预览版开始通过 Google AI Studio 中的 Gemini API 向开发者推出，并通过 Vertex AI 向企业推出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "cd5fba51bd180862",
      "translationZh": "毫不妥协的成本效益",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2c7dc67b375d1611",
      "translationZh": "3.1 Flash-Lite 的定价仅为每 1M 输入 token 0.25、每 1M 输出 token 1.50，以大型模型的一小部分成本提供更强的性能。根据 Artificial Analysis 基准测试，它的表现优于 2.5 Flash：首个答案 token 的生成速度快 2.5X，输出速度提升 45%，同时保持相当或更好的质量。高频工作流需要这种低延迟，因此它是开发者构建响应迅速的实时体验的理想模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aa8681cc8b0a2e75",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 3.1 Flash-Lite 在速度和质量上均优于 2.5 Flash。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4ee0d0618729467e",
      "translationZh": "3.1 Flash-Lite 在 Arena.ai 排行榜上取得了令人瞩目的 1432 Elo 分数，并在推理和多模态理解基准测试中超越其他同档位模型，其中在 GPQA Diamond 上达到 86.9%，在 MMMU Pro 上达到 76.8%——甚至超过了 2.5 Flash 等前几代规模更大的 Gemini 模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e49fa2f7a05157d9",
      "translationZh": "面向开发者的大规模自适应智能",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "de89a64dffd31248",
      "translationZh": "除了自身性能之外，Gemini 3.1 Flash-Lite 在 AI Studio 和 Vertex AI 中还标配思考级别设置，让开发者能够自主、灵活地选择模型为一项任务进行多少“思考”，这对于管理高频工作负载至关重要。3.1 Flash-Lite 可以大规模处理以成本为优先考量的任务，例如大批量翻译和内容审核。它也能处理需要更深入推理的复杂工作负载，例如生成用户界面和仪表板、创建模拟或遵循指令。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ae4e033d31cfae05",
      "translationZh": "3.1 Flash-Lite 能瞬间将数百种不同类别的产品填入电商线框图。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d956bbabd29081bd",
      "translationZh": "3.1 Flash-Lite 可以利用实时天气预报和历史数据，实时生成动态天气仪表盘。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "95106c18fdd0927d",
      "translationZh": "3.1 Flash-Lite 能创建一个 SaaS 智能体，为企业执行多种多步骤任务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8ca103d0ac44265d",
      "translationZh": "3.1 Flash-Lite 可以快速分析和分类图像等大量内容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e0fbd549e4be69d",
      "translationZh": "AI Studio 和 Vertex AI 上的抢先体验开发者，以及 Latitude、Cartwheel 和 Whering 等公司，已经在使用 3.1 Flash-Lite 大规模解决复杂问题。早期测试者强调了 3.1 Flash-Lite 的效率和推理能力，表示它处理复杂输入时能达到更高档位模型的精确度，还能遵循指令并始终保持对指令的遵从。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c818a3c5a61cc9c1",
      "translationZh": "我们期待看到你使用 3.1 Flash-Lite 和 Gemini 3 系列的其他模型构建的成果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ba07e0e30582b629",
      "translationZh": "在收件箱中接收 Google 的最新消息",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d1c2f6429af68386",
      "translationZh": "完成。只差最后一步。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "177af4ad1775d8ae",
      "translationZh": "请查看您的收件箱，确认您的订阅。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5ff091e7a47df15e",
      "translationZh": "您也可以使用一个 来订阅。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fefef2f9c6cb957b",
      "translationZh": "我们在2026年9月公布的最新AI消息",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "81c0514443d15d43",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 4 Argon：开启我们的前沿智能新时代",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4f32c94e810121bc",
      "translationZh": "观看 Future Vision XPRIZE 的获奖预告片 The Gifted。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1dcfa6e64bf1becb",
      "translationZh": "看看4位开发者正在用 Gemini 3.8 Flash 打造什么",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "39afd3b78512f5a1",
      "translationZh": "推出配备 Live Avatar 的 Gemini 3.8 Live",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8c6c3ba8ca3a0a1e",
      "translationZh": "作者：Shuo-yiin Chang 和 CJ Zheng",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "heading",
